The MIT licence above covers the original work in this repository: both plugins'
skills, scripts, documentation, and the measurement harness.

It does NOT cover the bundled third-party assets under
design-forge/skills/art-department/library/ (icon sets, fonts, textures, ornament), which
remain under their own licences. Those are enumerated with their licence, the
upstream source, and where each licence was verified, in:

  - design-forge/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
  - design-forge/skills/art-department/library/manifest.json

The craft notes under story-forge/references/writing/ summarise publicly posted
third-party material and each names its source in frontmatter; see the README in
that directory for what was deliberately excluded and why.

Some of those licences carry redistribution obligations of their own. If you
fork or redistribute this repository, those obligations travel with the assets.
